<title>FRANCE: French coffee imports down year/year in November.</title>
<headline>French coffee imports down year/year in November.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>French coffee imports in November issued by French customs included (in tonnes) -</p>
<p>- Coffee not roasted not decaffeinated -</p>
<p>		   Nov 96   Nov 95     Jan/Nov 96	 Jan/Nov 95</p>
<p>Ivory Coast     4,001    3,835	 43,821	   42,522</p>
<p>Cameroon	    435	982	 15,220	    9,964</p>
<p>Brazil	    3,958    3,910	 40,873	   49,078</p>
<p>Colombia	  2,509    3,099	 30,683	   29,509</p>
<p>World total    23,539   25,805	292,034	  273,438</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
